---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import photo from "../assets/photos/careers.jpg";
---

<Base
  title="Careers"
  description="How to approach the Dempo Group for work: the address and inbox published on dempos.com. No vacancies are invented."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap split" data-reveal>
      <div class="prose">
        <span class="kicker">Careers</span>
        <h1 style="font-size: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 4.8rem)">The house as an employer.</h1>
        <p class="lede">
          The careers page welcomes readers to the House of Dempo as a Goa-based business
          group and an employer of choice. It does not list open roles.
        </p>
        <p>
          <span class="tag">[Placeholder: client to supply]</span>
        </p>
        <p>
          Current vacancies, disciplines and locations are not published on the careers
          page that was studied. This concept will not invent job openings. When the Group
          shares a live list, it belongs here.
        </p>
        <h2>How the site asks people to apply</h2>
        <p>
          Complete the online application on dempos.com, or post a CV to the General Manager,
          Human Resources. The homepage uses a different title for the same desk: Senior
          General Manager (Human Resources). Both are reproduced rather than merged.
        </p>
        <address class="address">
          General Manager – Human Resources<br />
          Dempo Group of Companies<br />
          Dempo House, Campal<br />
          Dayanand Bandodkar Road<br />
          P. O. Box 34, Panaji 403001<br />
          Goa, India
        </address>
        <p style="margin-top: 1rem">
          <a href="https://www.dempos.com/careers/online-application-form/">
            Online application on dempos.com
          </a>
        </p>
        <p class="muted">
          That form belongs to the live site. The form on this concept’s contact page does
          not submit anywhere.
        </p>
      </div>
      <figure class="figure" data-reveal>
        <Image
          src={photo}
          alt="A classroom discussion, the photograph used on the Dempo careers page."
          widths={[500, 900]}
          sizes="(min-width: 800px) 46vw, 100vw"
        />
        <figcaption>Photograph from the careers page on dempos.com. The people are not identified there.</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
